= Return of the Scythian

The Scythian has returned, carrying with her the burdensome book of sinister sworcery known as the Megatome and an unshakeable certainty that the haunted darkness of the Mingi Taw has followed her.

- @acquire_megatome: Take the Megatome.

@acquire_megatome
subtitle: The burdensome book of sinister sworcery
achievement: megatome

We take the Megatome. The world is quiet here. We spot an antlered skull floating in the distance atop a cloud of darkness. The Scythian tells us gravely that this timeline is done for, and to carry forth our struggle in a new timeline. Our woeful errands are far from over, but we may still be cosmic friends forever.

- @game_over: The Gogolithic Mass consumes the world. 